msgid "!!! tip \"Network environments in the Chinese mainland\""
msgstr "!!! tip \"中国大陆网络环境\""

msgid "If the current environment cannot access Hugging Face reliably, a failed model download often first appears as a connection timeout, DNS failure, or other network error. The error message might not clearly identify the download source as the cause."
msgstr "如果当前环境无法稳定访问 Hugging Face，模型下载失败时通常先看到连接超时、DNS 或其他网络错误，不一定能从错误信息中直接判断是下载源问题。"

msgid "Before running the offline inference or online serving examples below, consider switching to ModelScope:"
msgstr "在运行下面的离线推理或在线服务之前，建议切换到 ModelScope："

msgid "If the model has already been downloaded locally, replace the model ID in the example with the local directory. You do not need to set this environment variable."
msgstr "如果模型已经下载到本地，请直接把示例中的模型 ID 替换为本地目录，不需要设置该环境变量。"
